      "side": 1,
      "message": "The guard checks alive.expired() only before the call. If the method itself causes the update manager to release this updater (for example by completing the update or resetting the activation state), failAndCancelUpdate() then runs on a freed object. Please check alive.expired() again after the method returns, and before failAndCancelUpdate(). The same reasoning applies to anything the handler touches after the member call.",
